{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15783","headline":"逢江客问南中故人因以诗寄 · 司空曙","name":"逢江客问南中故人因以诗寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南客何时去，相逢问故人。\n望乡空泪落，嗜酒转家贫。\n疎嬾辞微禄，东西任老身。\n上楼多看月，临水共伤春。\n五柳终期隐，双鸥自可亲。\n应怜折腰吏，冉冉在风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}